WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:05.990
<i>Raiou is a pretty famous prep school,</i>

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>but it's especially famous 
for its golf club.</i>

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.980
<i>It's won 13 tournaments in the last 3 years.</i>

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.230
<i>With the financial backing 
of Athena, the golf brand,</i>

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.620
<i>it offers a wide variety of 
facilities, as well as a dorm.</i>

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.590
<i>So talented golfers from all 
over the country come here.</i>

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.680
Hey.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.790
What?

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.600
Who are they?

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.020
They're curious about you.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.300
You're the first exchange 
student we've ever had,

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.460
and you're a hot, thin, blonde girl, 
which only makes it worse.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:44.720
Stop staring at me! This isn't a show!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.730
Eve, you shouldn't go 
making enemies like that.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:53.240
Also, your panties are showing.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:57.730
We can't let a transfer student 
in without even an exam.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.740
We need her help!

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:05.200
To win the All-Japan Girls High 
School Golf Doubles Championship!

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.670
Athena, our school's main sponsor

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:12.150
and the ones running the
championship, need us to win!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.620
T-That's...

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.010
The exchange student!

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.880
Aoi Amawashi!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:55.860
You...

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:57.360
Let's play—

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.820
How did you like your first day, Eve?

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:04.410
Forget that! Let's play!

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:08.910
You're the one who said that if I signed up 
to this school, I could play you all I wanted!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.290
I waited the whole day! Now let's play!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.510
I came all the way to Japan to play you, 
since you wanted to play!

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.420
Oh, Eve, are you upset?

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.680
I'm <i>extremely</i> upset!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:29.560
I'd love to play too, but...

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.600
Sorry. Aoi has a practice match.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.520
She's heading to another prefecture.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.530
Then take me with you!

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.120
We can settle this there!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.690
And see who's the better golfer...

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:45.600
Impossible. You're not 
part of the golf club.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.160
Let's go, Aoi.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.430
Sorry, Eve.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.580
We can play when I get back.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:55.310
Oh, why don't you join the golf club?

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.380
We can play a whole bunch then.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:01.000
What's her problem?

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.770
What are you staring at?

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:06.340
Sorry!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.040
She's a mad dog!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.290
A real mad dog!

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:15.840
Aoi, why did you bring her to the school?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:18.490
And have her join the golf club, too?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.820
To be with her forever, of course.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.840
I want to play golf 
with her for the rest of my life.

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:25.990
That doesn't mean...

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.070
I need her.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.240
My golf needs her.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.480
Aoi...

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.360
She started playing golf at the age of 3.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:43.250
She's now 15 and hasn't lost a single match.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:48.010
I'm sure that'll be a little different 
when she gets to high school.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.430
But what she wants more than anything

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:55.720
<i>is someone who's her equal.</i>

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.400
<i>A rival.</i>

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.980
<i>Evangeline is Frightfully Upset</i>

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
Club Entry Form

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
Club Advisor

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
I would like to join the Golf Club. I will work hard once I am admitted.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
Student's Name

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
Guardian's Name

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.440
You want to join the golf club?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.950
Evangeline F. Kimishima...

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.890
Just call me Eve. It's shorter.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.400
Watch your mouth.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.790
We welcome anyone with talent, of course.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:17.960
With <i>talent</i>, that is.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.910
Want to play a match, then?

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:20.880
Watch your mouth!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:24.100
You wouldn't stand
a chance against me.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.760
You think you're better than me?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.760
Yup. I do.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.020
Eve, that's enough!

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.030
Let me go!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.260
I woke up this morning 
and had to wear this weird uniform,

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:38.060
take these weird classes, 
and have everybody staring at me!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.890
I'm pissed off!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.900
You won't be able to join the team!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:46.080
I don't care! I'm just here to play Aoi!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.190
Where did Aoi go?

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.790
You think I'll tell you?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.430
Eve!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.930
<i>What is </i>wrong<i> with everyone here?</i>

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.260
You're sure about this, Coach?

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.180
About what?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:21.500
I thought you were going to 
have her play in my place.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.040
Play alongside Amawashi in

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.200
the All-Japan Girls High School Golf
Doubles Championship, that is.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:29.070
I'm leaving her alone for the time being.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:30.790
Why?

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:35.270
There's no sense in playing 
someone who doesn't want to fight.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.460
Don't worry. I've sowed the seeds.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.840
Let's go!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.050
Let's go get some food.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.290
Eve!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.250
Eve, where are you going?

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:47.800
Leave me alone!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.370
Calm down a little.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.540
Once you join the golf club, 
you can go to the dorms.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.540
And you get three meals a day.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.360
Eve, you've got nowhere to go, right?

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:04.940
I think joining the golf club 
is kind of your best choice...

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.200
Where should we go?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:06.920
Hey.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.150
What's your name?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.030
Keiko Mukai.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.910
Akemi Sakoi.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:20.620
I just arrived in Japan and don't 
know what's around here.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.840
Can you tell me what's 
around here that's fun?

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.290
S-Sure...

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.880
W-With pleasure.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.920
Thanks!

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.250
Um, you're Evangeline, right?

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.440
The exchange student.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.720
Just call me Eve.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.140
O-Okay!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.140
A lady-killer...

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.420
A lady-killer and a mad dog!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.410
I see!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:55.290
Yup!

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:47.750
I need to get home.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.220
I've got curfew too...

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.550
Curfew?

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:56.420
My parents want me back home by a certain hour.

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.480
That's curfew.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.310
If I don't get back by then, 
my parents will get mad at me...

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.260
Sorry.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.900
I see.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.190
Sorry for keeping you out late.

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:08.480
No, it was fun!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.190
Thanks for the stuffed animal!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.000
Do you know how to get home?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.200
I'll be fine.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.640
Let's hang out again, Eve!

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.160
Bye!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.740
They want you at home, huh?

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.120
You don't have a curfew?

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.740
There's a curfew at the dorms...

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.440
But we're way past it.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.170
They'll get mad at us.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.180
Why are you stalking me?

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.170
Because I want to be your caddy.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.430
Why?

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.340
I want to be a pro caddy.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.170
So I want to pair up with the best.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:57.930
With you, I think we could place, no,

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.580
<i>win</i> the All-Japan Girls High 
School Golf Doubles Championship!

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:04.840
If you want to be a caddy that bad, 
why not ask Aoi Amawashi?

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:10.320
She's already got one. Shinjo's her caddy.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:12.860
Can I win?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.250
If I pair with you, can I beat Aoi Amawashi?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.930
Um, well...

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:23.080
You can!

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.980
We can win!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:28.760
Then when I play Aoi, be my caddy.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.570
Okay! I will!

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:35.860
Did I hear what I think I heard?

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:40.240
You're going to beat Aoi Amawashi?

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.070
Are you serious?

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.070
Who are you?

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.040
Iseshiba...

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.320
Kuyo Iseshiba.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.470
A second-year student on the 
Shizuoka Koran Girls High Golf Club.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.920
She's a regular at the nationals.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.990
Thank you for the introduction.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:00.100
Am I that famous, though?

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:04.650
I memorize the names of all 
the players at the nationals.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.130
And who are you?

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:10.100
I'm Ichina Saotome, 
a first-year with the Raiou Golf Club.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:10.640
This is...

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.160
Don't bother telling her.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:15.980
I only give my name to people who excite me.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.890
And I don't excite you.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.060
Why do you pick fights with everyone?

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.530
She may not be from our school, 
but she's older than us.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:29.610
I don't mind. I'm not here to make friends.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.880
If I beat you at that, 
will you tell me your name?

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:38.480
I'm quite good at putting, you see.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.290
And good enough to beat Aoi Amawashi, too.

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:44.670
Fine. I'm in.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:49.390
I've been in a bad mood all day.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.430
Sorry, but I'm going to take it out on you.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.860
Go for it.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.120
I'll pierce you through...

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.100
...with my bullet!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.910
Adventure Golf

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:06.830
Who takes honor?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.610
The lesser player.

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:11.280
You really are a brat.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.180
<i>I've got it.</i>

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:34.940
<i>She got it in without deviating 
a single millimeter from the ideal line!</i>

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:39.540
<i>So this is the power 
of Koran's Kuyo Iseshiba,</i>

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.690
<i>the one they call "Search the Line"!</i>

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.780
<i>I've never seen Eve putt before.</i>

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.830
If you want to be my caddy,

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.460
learn about how I play golf first.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:58.510
<i>Eve, I'm watching closely...</i>

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.960
<i>Insatiable...</i>

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.100
<i>Green Bullet!</i>

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:16.300
<i>Y-You're not supposed to just ignore the line!</i>

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:21.560
<i>If she'd been off even a little, 
she would've overshot the green!</i>

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:25.570
<i>S-She's too aggressive...</i>

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.000
The way you putt is ridiculous.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.080
To me, it's the proper way to putt.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.720
<i>Insatiable...</i>

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.380
<i>Green Bullet.</i>

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:51.140
<i>T-That's even worse!</i>

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.660
<i>This isn't even putting anymore!</i>

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.530
Got a problem?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.040
Nope. Not in the slightest.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.960
<i>She's aggressive, she's brutish...</i>

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:33.360
<i>But she keeps getting holes in one.</i>

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.690
<i>So this is Eve's golf.</i>

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.440
<i>A way to play that's only possible for her,</i>

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:42.690
<i>that only she can use!</i>

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.190
<i>How can she play like this?</i>

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:51.740
<i>Every shot she takes is a gamble,</i>

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:54.000
<i>like walking a tightrope!</i>

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.560
<i>But it's incredible to watch...</i>

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.940
<i>I can't take my eyes off it!</i>

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.460
<i>A golf that entrances all who see it...</i>

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.670
<i>Search!</i>

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.530
<i>The line!</i>

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.500
<i>I've shot her through.</i>

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.640
Stop.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.570
K-Kaoruko!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.170
She and I are a pair.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.710
Can we switch places?

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.370
Sure, if you want.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.920
Thanks.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.570
I like you.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.160
You've got me excited.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.840
Let me take your place, Kuyo.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.760
Kaoruko, this is between me and her...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.840
If you keep this up, 
you're going to miss a shot.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.140
Please. Let me take over.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.940
You're our best player.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.950
Thank you, Kuyo.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:13.720
Kaoruko Iijima, a 3rd year student at Koran.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.240
Captain and top player of their golf club.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.400
And 6th place in last year's All Girls.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.320
A true top player!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:29.160
<i>Watching the irregular way she 
plays has affected your mind.</i>

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:33.880
<i>If you keep playing, she'll crush you.</i>

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:39.350
<i>I can't let her destroy my partner.</i>

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.560
<i>A wedge?</i>

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.310
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.360
<i>Of course she knows this,</i>

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:49.310
<i>but putting is a lot easier 
than doing an approach shot!</i>

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.310
<i>So why?</i>

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:54.900
<i>In the Zone.</i>

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.230
<i>W-What just happened?</i>

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:11.170
<i>Her powers of concentration...</i>

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:14.380
<i>This is her specialty.</i>

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:18.520
<i>She shuts off her senses of 
hearing, taste, and smell,</i>

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:21.380
<i>to give her incredible concentration powers!</i>

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>She calls it "In the Zone".</i>

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.970
Nice hole in one, Kaoruko.

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.500
Thank you, Kuyo.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.780
Wow.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:58.080
You're the second person 
to impress me with a shot!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.680
Who was the first, may I ask?

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.520
Aoi Amawashi.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.840
I see. Makes sense.

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.130
Go ahead.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.570
No, Eve.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:13.750
What?

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.600
If you shoot like that, you'll miss.

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.200
It's an easy hole.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.070
You'll still miss.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.330
Get off me!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.540
Believe me!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:27.280
Believe in your caddy!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.170
What happened?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.320
It's a trap.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.040
A trap?

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.390
Iijima's shot back there.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:44.340
She shot it high deliberately to make 
a dent in the ground in front of the cup.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:50.320
If you shoot straight, 
it'll hit the dent and go off course.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:54.240
So she was laying a trap from the start?

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.190
Yup.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.440
So what do we do?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.650
We calculate.

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.620
<i>Look... find it!</i>

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.000
<i>Find the best answer!</i>

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.040
I see it!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.710
See the ball here...

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:22.060
If your strongest swing is a 10,

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.740
hit with a 6.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.060
Don't aim for the cup...

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.060
aim for the dent.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.900
Any other way?

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:30.950
Nope.

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:36.750
If I pair with you, can I beat Aoi Amawashi?

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:38.380
You can!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.700
We can win!

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.690
I guess I've got to do what 
my personal caddy says, huh?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.450
Eve...

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:50.170
<i>So she found the trap.</i>

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.050
<i>She's smarter than she looks.</i>

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.820
<i>Trusting...</i>

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.310
<i>Green Bullet.</i>

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.770
Nice work, Eve!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.380
Good work, shrimp.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.950
Don't make comments about my height, please!

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:20.650
So, what's your name again?

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.360
Ichina!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.230
Ichina Saotome!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.800
Great job, shrimp!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.890
You're supposed to 
say my name after I tell you!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:33.170
Just like with your golfing, 
you're ignoring the rules!

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:38.450
I'm sorry, but that's all for today.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:43.310
I think we could be here all 
night and still not finish.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.650
I see.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:46.230
Fine by me.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.570
Have a splendid night, then.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.260
Let's go, Kuyo.

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:51.230
Okay.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.390
You, I'll give my name.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.240
Evangeline. Call me Eve.

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:04.790
Koran Girls Golf Club Captain, 
Kaoruko Iijima, third-year.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.610
A pleasure.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.040
All right, Eve,

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:13.790
I'll see you at the All-Japan Girls 
High School Golf Doubles Championship!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.330
So um, what's this All-Japan thing?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:24.080
The All-Japan Girls High School 
Golf Doubles Championship?

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.510
It's a new tournament.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:30.180
And Kaoruko Iijima will be there?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:35.520
Yeah, probably in a pair with Kuyo Iseshiba.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.910
I'm hungry.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.290
Let's get some food before we head back.

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:48.050
We're way past curfew, 
so I may as well tag along.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:55.570
I met the person you were talking about.

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:58.540
I was planning on just having Kuyo play her,

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:00.920
but I couldn't help myself.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.320
You're a cruel man.

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:07.550
That could have crushed her, Coach Amuro.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.640
<i>That could have crushed her, Coach Amuro.</i>

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:12.260
It all worked out, though, right?

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:15.690
You got to see one of your 
competitors in the championship.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:19.880
Yes, I'm looking forward to 
seeing you there.

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:21.190
Adieu.

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:22.100
Is something wrong?

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:24.100
I want you to let me in the golf club.

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:25.800
To enter you need...

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.780
I'll take a test, if I have to.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:32.000
No, the test is over.

00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:34.500
I'll be expecting you
in the club starting tomorrow.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.510
Yes! Yes!

00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:39.350
Yes!!

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:50.020
Next Episode

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:42.260
Hey, caddy! Who’s that girl?

00:23:42.260 --> 00:23:44.110
Kinue Jinguji, 
the president of the golf club.

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:46.030
She's overworking me!

00:23:46.030 --> 00:23:47.090
She hurts you 'cause you loves you.

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:48.530
More Birdie Birdie next week!

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:50.530
Not again!
